	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Remitto tibi <persName>Gerionis</persName> et <persName ref="p8009">Fabritii</persName> literas, hono<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>rande domine compater, et ago simul magnas gratias <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>pro earum communicatione.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scribitur ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> quoque <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>de caesis pontificiis et <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName> auxiliaribus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ipsorum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Fertur item in <placeName ref="l2589">Picardia</placeName> quoque regem 10 <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>amisisse cohortes; itaque novas Helvetiorum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>copias illuc evocat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l160">Friburgenses</placeName> hac transituri <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>erant hisce diebus <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> versus, sed mutato <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>consilio rex in <placeName ref="l2589">Picardiam</placeName> eos festinare iubet.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Sic miseri et coeci homines hisce turbis et angustiis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>se immiscent, quae tandem in ipsorum capita <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>redundant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Utinam nostri exemplum inde caperent!</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Quod <persName>Gallos</persName> nostros attinet, non sine ratione mihi semper <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>suspecti sunt; moliuntur omnino, ut aliquem Buceranism<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>um nobis obtrudant.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Cavendum ergo in tempore.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Si principes nos evocassent ad colloquium, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>omnino prius nobis conveniendum erat et negotium <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>hoc inter nos ante omnia disceptandum, et hoc <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ipsi debuerant expectare; nunc suis no prae<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>vertunt confessionibus et tanto nos gravant <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>praeiudicio.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Ich bin auch übel mitt inen zfriden,</foreign> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nec impune feret <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName>, postquam hoc communiter <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fuerit cognitum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ego adhuc silentio omnia premo; <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>metuo etiam novum schisma inter nos; non <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>enim deessent, quibus de veteris contentionis ali<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>quid adhuc adhaeret fermento, qui gaudebunt, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>si videant suarum obscuritatum se novos habere <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>confessores et defensores.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Consule, quęso, (quid<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>) putes nobis cum <persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> agendum esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">In <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> wil es je lenger je böser werden.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>(Der) präsidennt von <placeName>Camerach</placeName> hatt min herren gewar(net), <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>irthalb guͦt ufsehens zuͦ han; dann si habind <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>etwas verhanden.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Min herren glaubends zum theil, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>zum theil nüt, und achtet man, man hatzte uns <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sonst gern an einander.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Der küng hatt in <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>das <placeName>Fustini</placeName> land hinder <placeName>Jonve</placeName> ettliche reisige <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>glegt, frylich uff das zuͦ warten.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Ich sorg übel, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>es werd nüt guͦts drus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Mitt den unseren, so si <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>gen <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> kömmend, darff nieman reden, auch on <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>erlaupnuß deß raths kein gsellschafft halten.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Die <placeName ref="l832">Frantzosen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>regierend da; die allten burger dörffend sich nüt lan mercken.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Gott well, das es zuͦ guͦtem diene, Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Haec <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>raptim ad tuas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri omnes amantissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>20. augusti 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>. Hall</persName>. tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae pastori fidelissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et compatri suo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>colendissimo charissimoque.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
